 most several hundred thousand for dragonblooded. In an area bigger than the earth.<br /> <br /> I think maybe there should be a medical facility for enhancing people. Like... Free plastic surgery","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T12:22:42-07:00","id":1420306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419945-the-palace-of-pleasure?p=1420236#post1420236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The problem is that exalts are rare. Very very rare. <br /> <br /> Like at most several hundred thousand for dragonblooded. In an area bigger than the earth.<br /> <br /> I think maybe there should be a medical facility for enhancing people. Like... Free plastic surgery</div> </div> </div> </div>The enhancement facility is a good idea. And there aren\u2019t that many super rich people irl either, but they all tend to hang out at the same places. Just sayin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T16:19:50-07:00","id":1420341,"title":"","content":"<div cla